sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Developer
    participant AI as AI IDE
    participant Codebase

    Developer->>AI: /openspec-explore <feature idea>
    AI->>Codebase: Inspect the existing project
    Codebase-->>AI: Return code and project context
    AI-->>Developer: Ask questions and clarify the idea

    Developer->>AI: /openspec-propose <feature idea>
    AI->>Codebase: Create the change artifacts
    Codebase-->>AI: Save proposal, specs, design, and tasks
    AI-->>Developer: Present the reviewable change plan

    Developer->>AI: /openspec-apply-change <change-id>
    AI->>Codebase: Read the change artifacts and tasks
    loop For each task
        AI->>Codebase: Implement the task and update the code
        Codebase-->>AI: Save the code changes
        AI-->>Developer: Report implementation progress
    end
    AI-->>Developer: Confirm implementation is complete

    Developer->>AI: /openspec-archive-change <change-id>
    AI->>Codebase: Update the main specifications
    AI->>Codebase: Move the change folder to the archive
    Codebase-->>AI: Save updated specs and archived change
    AI-->>Developer: Confirm the change is archived
